  "label": "The text 'Muslim kids' is mapped onto the diverse group of children in the image.",
  "description": "The text overlay 'when the muslim kids in your class start hanging out with you' explicitly refers to 'Muslim kids' as the subject of the scenario. The visual material depicts a diverse group of children engaged in various physical activities, which is mapped onto the textual concept of 'Muslim kids'. This mapping implies that the children in the image represent the 'Muslim kids' mentioned in the text, even though the visual material does not visually indicate religious identity. The mapping is based on the textual reference and the visual representation of children, creating an analogical relationship where the visual children are understood as the 'Muslim kids' in the context of the meme's narrative.",
